    "mf-auto-2004": "1. Upon unboxing, you will find the hyperDENT installation kit.",
    "mf-auto-2005": "2. Installation & Initialization USB (Top): Used for installing hyperDENT and factory-resetting the machine. Keep it safe after installation as it is required for machine initialization.",
    "mf-auto-2006": "hyperDENT Dongle (Bottom): Must be plugged in to run hyperDENT.",
    "mf-auto-2007": "3. Insert the installation USB and the dongle as shown in the picture.",
    "mf-auto-2008": "4. After inserting the USB, run the application as shown on the screen. It is an auto-installation program.",
    "mf-auto-2009": "5. Now follow the on-screen instructions to proceed with the installation.",
    "mf-auto-2010": "6. The auto-installation program will install hyperDENT first.",
    "mf-auto-2011": "7. You can select the language. It can be changed anytime after installation. (Recommended: English & Korean)",
    "mf-auto-2012": "10. Check the agreement and click Next.",
    "mf-auto-2013": "12. You can change the hyperDENT installation path, but it is recommended to keep the default.",
    "mf-auto-2014": "16. The hyperDENT installation is complete. Click Finish.",
    "mf-auto-2015": "17. After installation, the auto-installation program will automatically configure hyperDENT.",
    "mf-auto-2016": "18. The hyperDENT installation and setup are fully complete!",
    "mf-auto-2017": "19. If these messages do not appear when running hyperDENT, it was installed successfully.",
    "mf-auto-2018": "20. Run hyperDENT, press F4, and check the path shown.",
