    "mf-auto-2186": "③ T01, T23 tools",
    "mf-auto-3033": "2. How to Calculate",
    "mf-auto-2187": "Finish settings as usual and press the calculate button.",
    "mf-auto-2188": "After calculation, go to the \"Show toolpaths\" menu to edit the NC file.",
